CI  .github/workflows/ci.yml  on push main, pull_request
  Test  ubuntu-latest
    npm ci                       Install dependencies with npm  ↓ download
    npm test                     Run Vitest tests
    npm run build …              Build app with Vite, then run Playwright end-to-end tests
    import shutil, subprocess …  Run python script
  deploy  ubuntu-latest
    npx wrangler deploy  Deploy Cloudflare Worker  [external]

GitLab CI  .gitlab-ci.yml
  unit  test
    npm ci    Install dependencies with npm  ↓ download
    npm test  Run Vitest tests
  pages  deploy
    npx wrangler deploy  Deploy Cloudflare Worker  [external]
